        <template>
            <uuid>4f39bc276a1d4b68a529e46a7102b4d9</uuid>
            <template>FS S5850-24B4C</template>
            <name>FS S5850-24B4C by SNMP and SSH</name>
            <description>Community template for FS S5850-24B4C (tested: FSOS 7.5.5, Zabbix 7.4). FS proprietary SNMP OIDs provide CPU (three windows), used memory and firmware version. SSH show environment provides fan/PSU health, PSU power consumption and two temperatures. Set host macros {$FS.SSH.IP}, {$FS.SSH.USER}, {$FS.SSH.PASSWORD}. Use alongside Network Generic Device by SNMP for interface monitoring. Not an official FS template; other models and firmware versions have not been verified.</description>
            <groups>
                <group>
                    <name>Templates/Network devices</name>
                </group>
            </groups>
